         pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: libnss3-tools
Description: system tray monitor and controller for adguard-cli
 Shows AdGuard status in the system tray, starts and stops adguard-cli,
 and manages filters, userscripts, HTTPS certificates and activity
 statistics. Works on Wayland and X11 (KDE Plasma, Hyprland, and others).
 .
 This package builds the upstream project at
 https://github.com/RiDDiX/adguard-tray without modifying it.
 adguard-cli itself is not included; install it with the official
 upstream script.
